OL,3,GNEWSAFairfield review 'vindicates'
OL,4,Avictim blamed by Met
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who was victim-blamed by the
OL,7,FMetropolitan Police after she tried to
OL,8,Freport a predatory police officer says
OL,9,Fshe feels "vindicated" by the findings
OL,10,Fof a major report into the force.
OL,12,FThe Fairfield review said institutional
OL,13,Fmisogyny, racism and homophobia still
OL,14,Fexisted in the Met, three years after a
OL,15,Fdamning report by Baroness Casey called
OL,16,Ffor urgent reforms.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
