OL,3,GNEWSAFairfield review 'vindicates'
OL,4,Avictim blamed by Met
OL,5,
OL,6,FLorraine - not her real name - was
OL,7,Famong the cases featured in the Casey
OL,8,Freview in 2023, which said she had been
OL,9,F"traumatised" both by PC Phil Hunter
OL,10,Fand by her treatment by the Met's
OL,11,FProfessional Standards unit.
OL,13,FThe Met has previously apologised to
OL,14,FLorraine, and said it accepted the
OL,15,Ffindings of Dr Gillian Fairfield's
OL,16,Freport.
